{{!-- The brand kit's compact nav lockup: icon (343x372, shown 30x33) + horizontal wordmark (1171x116, shown 170x17), the
      kit's own PNGs at their exact ratios (0.922:1 and 10.09:1). Both files are large enough for 2x screens. The kit's
      SVGs are wrappers around an <image> with no data, so the PNGs are the masters here. Decorative: callers add the text. --}}
<span class="gl-lockup" aria-hidden="true">
    <img class="gl-lockup-icon" src="{{asset "brand/icon/gully-labs-icon.png"}}" width="30" height="33" alt="" decoding="async">
    <img class="gl-lockup-wordmark" src="{{asset "brand/logo/gully-labs-wordmark-horizontal.png"}}" width="170" height="17" alt="" decoding="async">
</span>
